"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["最省事的是去有人管的正规冰场，不用多花钱。非要上野外的冰，就带冰钻或冰镩打孔量厚度。再买一对救生冰锥，就是两根带握柄的尖钉，挂在胸前。这些加起来几十到一两百元。每走一段量一次，要多花些时间。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["中国气象局的科普说，冰层厚度达到 15 厘米，成年人可以上去滑冰。露天冰场的冰层也要达到 15 厘米才能开放。北京市水务局说，正规天然冰场要冰厚 15 厘米，之后一周气温保持在 -8℃ 到 1℃、没有大风，才能开放。野冰上常有钓鱼的人凿的冰洞，凿开后很难再冻结实。美国明尼苏达州自然资源部的指南只针对新结的透明冰：不到 4 英寸（约 10 厘米）别上，4 英寸可以步行和冰钓。积雪化了又冻上的白冰，结实程度只有透明冰的一半左右，厚度要按两倍算。同一片水面，冰可能这里一英尺厚，几英尺外只有一两英寸。流水上的冰通常危险，溪流、桥和涵洞附近尤其如此。岸边的冰也可能比远处薄。美国国家气象局给的步行、冰钓、滑冰门槛也是 4 英寸。加拿大职业健康与安全中心转述加拿大红十字会的建议：几个人一起滑冰、步行要 15 厘米，人多的滑冰聚会要 20 厘米。这些都是安全指南，没有研究算过照着做能少死多少人（全国 / 美国、加拿大）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["中国气象局 (2019). 想要冰上健步走，多厚的冰才安全？ ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cma.gov.cn/kppd/kppdqxyr/kppdtyqx/201901/t20190124_513302.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.cma.gov.cn/kppd/kppdqxyr/kppdtyqx/201901/t20190124_513302.html"]},"；北京市水务局 (2024). 北京正规河湖冰场还未达开放标准，别冒险滑「野冰」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://swj.beijing.gov.cn/swdt/ztzl/fnsbaqztxc/fnszlxx/202412/t20241226_3973959.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://swj.beijing.gov.cn/swdt/ztzl/fnsbaqztxc/fnszlxx/202412/t20241226_3973959.html"]},"；Minnesota Department of Natural Resources. General ice thickness guidelines. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/thickness.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/thickness.html"]},"；Minnesota Department of Natural Resources. Ice safety. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/index.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/index.html"]},"；Minnesota Department of Natural Resources. Steps for surviving immersion. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/survival.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.dnr.state.mn.us/safety/ice/survival.html"]},"；National Weather Service. Winter Weather Safety: Ice and Frost. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.weather.gov/safety/winter-ice-frost","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.weather.gov/safety/winter-ice-frost"]},"；Canadian Centre for Occupational Health and Safety. Working on or near Ice Covered Water - Basic Information. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ccohs.ca/oshanswers/hsprograms/work_ice.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ccohs.ca/oshanswers/hsprograms/work_ice.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.cma.gov.cn/kppd/kppdqxyr/kppdtyqx/201901/t20190124_513302.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["官方指南都说没有百分之百安全的冰，量够了厚度只是门槛，不是保证。刚上冻的初冬和开始化冰的初春最危险。真掉进去了，别脱衣服，厚衣服里存着空气能帮你浮着。转身朝来的方向，那边的冰最结实。手臂搭上冰面，把冰锥扎进冰里，脚往后蹬，把身子拖上来。上来后别站起来，平躺着滚离冰洞，再尽快取暖，冻得厉害的要去医院。看见别人掉进冰窟窿，别跑过去拉，做法见第 13 节第 25 条（看到有人溺水自己不下水）：先叫人、打 110，再递杆子、抛绳子。受益人主要是你自己和带去玩冰的孩子。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/01-40"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"查出骨质疏松，或者轻轻一摔就骨折过，就请医生开抗骨质疏松药并坚持用，别拿补钙